        <div class="mt-6 text-xs text-bae-muted border-t border-bae-border pt-4">
          <p>This report is an estimate for educational purposes only. Actual investment returns vary. Consult a qualified financial advisor before making investment decisions. Generated <span id="report-gen-date"></span>.</p>
